1
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,640
The air feels wrong.

2
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:51,000
Yin energy, death energy...

3
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:53,880
and a trace of something alive stirring.

4
00:00:54,119 --> 00:00:55,119
Who cares what energy it is!

5
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:55,679
Zhang Tianyou!

6
00:00:55,679 --> 00:00:57,079
Get over here and draw out the poison first!

7
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,040
You got this poison from years of handling corpses,

8
00:01:14,439 --> 00:01:16,760
with the poison seeping into your body through the skin.

9
00:01:22,799 --> 00:01:24,439
This Corpse Poison of yours is quite severe.

10
00:01:25,239 --> 00:01:27,400
You must have started raiding tombs as a kid.

11
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,760
We aren't as professional as The Four Great Families.

12
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,120
We have to risk our lives

13
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,680
just to get some underworld riches.

14
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,560
Zhang Tianyou,

15
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,519
don't forget what you promised me.

16
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:39,280
You'll carve out a large piece of Sheng family territory for me.

17
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:42,239
Don't worry.

18
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:46,400
I won't go back on my word.

19
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:49,079
You're quite bold.

20
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,159
No wonder my men said you were something else.

21
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:56,680
What did your men tell you?

22
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:59,280
I know your background is far from ordinary.

23
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,439
And becoming the Chief isn't your ultimate goal.

24
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,040
But do you know that

25
00:02:03,079 --> 00:02:05,159
even if you gather all the Talismans and Seal Eyes,

26
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,640
you still won't find the Tidal Tomb you're looking for?

27
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,080
Because

28
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:11,199
your Dragon-Seeking Ruler alone isn't enough.

29
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:12,039
You have to find the descendants of

30
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:13,680
the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family tied to that tomb.

31
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,479
But they died out a long time ago.

32
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,599
Something's wrong.

33
00:02:18,919 --> 00:02:19,919
What's wrong?

34
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:24,400
Do you remember when we first came in?

35
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:27,719
This statue's feet were pointing straight at the coffin.

36
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,199
Are they alive?

37
00:02:33,199 --> 00:02:34,120
They don't look like living things.

38
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:37,400
They're more like puppets driven by some force.

39
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,960
They turned around!

40
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:47,439
I get it now.

41
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:50,439
This isn't where the Qi family hides their talisman books.

42
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,240
These are the Mei family's seal-guarding puppets!

43
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,360
The Mei family's Celestial Seal must be hidden here.

44
00:02:56,479 --> 00:02:57,319
Get ready to open the coffin.

45
00:02:57,560 --> 00:03:00,280
Three, two, one. Open the coffin!

46
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,360
Let's go.

47
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:40,360
Tianting,

48
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:42,280
That outsider still can't be trusted.

49
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,439
I still need my son to step in personally.

50
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:45,039
Father.

51
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:46,639
Killing that brat

52
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:49,080
is as easy as squashing an ant.

53
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:52,639
I'm counting on you for tonight, my son.

54
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:54,199
Understood, Father.

55
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,479
Just wait and see.

56
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,039
Zhang Tianyou!

57
00:04:08,039 --> 00:04:09,039
You punk,

58
00:04:09,159 --> 00:04:12,159
you made me lose face in front of Ling Yu.

59
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:14,199
Tonight,

60
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,719
I'm going to show you

61
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:17,680
how ruthless I can be.

62
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:27,759
Did I get fat,

63
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:29,600
or did the wall get higher?

64
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:32,639
Young Master, that idiot has started.

65
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:34,720
It's fine. Our walls are high.

66
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,600
Let him have his fun.

67
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,439
I refuse to believe this!

68
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:50,000
Young Master, that idiot is still trying.

69
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,079
No rush.

70
00:04:51,079 --> 00:04:52,399
Let him get some exercise.

71
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:06,920
Young Master!

72
00:05:07,199 --> 00:05:08,360
He's almost up here.

73
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,480
So fast?

74
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:14,519
Thank heavens, I finally made it up.

75
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:17,759
Zhang Tianyou, your time is finally up.

76
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,439
You're finally here.

77
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,920
My leg!

78
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,680
My leg hurts!

79
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,399
My leg!

80
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:35,959
My leg is broken!

81
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,639
My leg's broken!

82
00:05:37,639 --> 00:05:39,040
I know.

83
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:41,120
Call a doctor!

84
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:43,519
My leg!

85
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,199
Easy, easy, easy.

86
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:46,439
Easy, easy, easy.

87
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:48,079
Easy, easy, easy.

88
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:48,879
My leg hurts!

89
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,199
VIP seating.

90
00:05:51,959 --> 00:05:53,040
For me?

91
00:05:53,759 --> 00:05:54,480
Thanks.

92
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,199
No problem.

93
00:05:56,519 --> 00:05:57,959
Steady now.

94
00:05:57,959 --> 00:05:59,120
My leg!

95
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:02,079
My leg!

96
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,680
He comes as he pleases,

97
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,720
and leaves as he pleases.

98
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,560
The Sheng family's walls are still too easy to scale.

99
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,319
Have someone build the walls higher tomorrow.

100
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:18,519
And smear some tung oil on them.

101
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,439
Got it.

102
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,040
Tianyou,

103
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:26,040
over the past twenty years,

104
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,120
people in the Sheng clan have been dying suddenly.

105
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,560
Could it really be related to

106
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:32,839
what we provoked in the Tidal Tomb back then?

107
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:34,720
But right now,

108
00:06:35,879 --> 00:06:37,319
there are only twelve days left

109
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:41,079
until that thing comes to claim our lives.

110
00:06:41,319 --> 00:06:44,120
So I must gather the Talismans and Seal Eyes as soon as possible,

111
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:46,759
go to the Tidal Tomb, and destroy that thing.

112
00:06:48,759 --> 00:06:52,240
Back then, The Four Great Families and the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family teamed up for Geomancy,

113
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:55,680
but only the four families made it out.

114
00:06:56,720 --> 00:07:00,120
Too many secrets from twenty years ago remain hidden.

115
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:01,680
It's a pity

116
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:04,079
I didn't even get the chance to ask your father

117
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:06,120
before he passed away.

118
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,879
Young Master!

119
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:07,920
Young Master!

120
00:07:09,439 --> 00:07:10,399
How is Young Master Qi?

121
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:11,199
He's been sent back.

122
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:12,439
Did he say anything?

123
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,519
He was fairly calm.

124
00:07:14,839 --> 00:07:16,199
Master Qi has a message for you.

125
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:16,519
He said...

126
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:17,040
I know.

127
00:07:17,759 --> 00:07:19,079
Did he say

128
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:21,920
that everyone in the Sheng family better wash our necks,

129
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,319
because he's coming to behead us all tomorrow?

130
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,639
You're so smart, Young Master!

131
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:28,439
Where's my luggage?

132
00:07:28,439 --> 00:07:29,120
I've packed everything for you.

133
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,879
Take care of yourself.

134
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:38,079
What are you guys doing?

135
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:51,560
Young Master

136
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:55,439
I brought the servants to pay respects to the Sheng Family Head.

137
00:07:56,399 --> 00:07:58,600
Paying respects to the Family Head.

138
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,600
Family Head.

139
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:02,360
You can't just abandon us!

140
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,600
Are you still leaving?

141
00:08:10,439 --> 00:08:11,680
I'll stay a bit longer.

142
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,759
My son's legs!

143
00:08:26,519 --> 00:08:29,959
Master, please don't be too heartbroken.

144
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:32,600
Take care of your own health.

145
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:36,960
The Qi family is still counting on you.

146
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,679
If you collapse too,

147
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:41,559
how am I supposed to live?

148
00:08:41,879 --> 00:08:42,679
Get out.

149
00:08:43,279 --> 00:08:46,000
I want to be alone with Ting'er for a bit.

150
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:46,960
Let's go.

151
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,159
What is Dad going to do from now on?

152
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:00,679
Mother.

153
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,960
How is my dad?

154
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:03,679
Your dad?

155
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:07,320
He's having a deep emotional exchange with your older brother right now.

156
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,759
What an idiot.

157
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:22,799
What will our Qi family do now?

158
00:09:23,039 --> 00:09:24,360
Dad!

159
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,679
Be gentle!

160
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:30,919
Dad!

161
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:32,240
Be gentle!

162
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:35,519
These are the keys to the Sheng family's thirteen warehouses.

163
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,919
Please check them.

164
00:09:40,399 --> 00:09:43,960
Here are the account details for the Sheng family's

165
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,639
antique shops, pawnshops, and pharmacies.

166
00:09:45,759 --> 00:09:46,799
Please look them over.

167
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:50,759
This is the territory distribution map

168
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:53,000
for the Sheng family among The Four Great Families.

169
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:55,000
Please review it.

170
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:00,519
Wan.

171
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:01,720
Mei.

172
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,639
Qi.

173
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,159
Where is the Sheng family?

174
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:11,320
Last year, the Qi and Sheng families redivided their territory.

175
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:13,559
What belongs to the Sheng family now

176
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,399
is right here.

177
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,600
According to the division,

178
00:10:18,759 --> 00:10:22,519
the Sheng family can only practice Geomancy and explore here.

179
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,480
It's not even the size of a fingernail.

180
00:10:30,519 --> 00:10:31,639
Hard to believe.

181
00:10:31,639 --> 00:10:35,159
The Sheng family has been bullied quite badly all these years.

182
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,399
All right.

183
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:41,320
Since I'm taking over the Sheng family,

184
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:42,159
well,

185
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,600
we must take our territory back.

186
00:10:44,799 --> 00:10:46,960
And win back our pride as well.

187
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:47,799
Good.

188
00:10:48,279 --> 00:10:51,240
Doesn't the Qi family love to uphold justice?

189
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:53,320
Get the car ready.

190
00:10:54,399 --> 00:10:55,759
No need to prepare any special outfits.

191
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:59,799
Just wrap up this Earth Vein Sutra for me.

192
00:10:59,799 --> 00:11:01,240
As a thank-you gift.

193
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,240
Before I return,

194
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:05,480
sort out all these accounts for me.

195
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:06,240
Remember,

196
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:09,480
I didn't take over the Sheng family to listen to stories.

197
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:13,879
I'm here to rewrite them.

198
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:14,960
Yes, sir.

199
00:11:20,039 --> 00:11:21,279
Is it really just you alone?

200
00:11:21,279 --> 00:11:22,120
What did you expect?

201
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:23,799
They said following you is a death wish.

202
00:11:23,799 --> 00:11:25,120
What idiot would willingly follow?

203
00:11:25,799 --> 00:11:26,919
Don't worry.

204
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,840
I am the face of the Sheng family now.

205
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:30,159
That old fox Qi Lianhai,

206
00:11:30,159 --> 00:11:31,240
even if he wants to drop all pretenses,

207
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,759
he still has to consider if there are other eyes watching.

208
00:11:33,759 --> 00:11:34,559
Right?

209
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,440
Let's hope so.

210
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,960
If that still doesn't work,

211
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:01,759
I still have the Mei family's Celestial Seal.

212
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,519
Rats!

213
00:12:05,039 --> 00:12:05,799
Rats!

214
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:06,519
Ra-
